    LLM: 'After house card is shown, players bet on Andar or Bahar. Dealer deals alternately to the two piles. First pile to receive a card matching the house card wins. Payouts: first-dealt pile ~1:1, other pile ~0.9:1. Optional second bet after first two cards if no match.',
